    "enUS": {
      "description": "Give me room while I perform a ritual of divination.  I will find the connection between the feather you brought me and its owner, and follow that connection to Sharpbeak himself.\n\nThat is... I will if all goes according to plan.  If it does not, then... you better close your eyes.",
